/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 66 730 [
[(This patch calculates the loop frequency as a function of desired)]
[(transposition. We get the inverse of the chunk size in seconds,)]
[(which corresponds to its frequency in Hz andmultiply it by a)]
[(transposition ratio. A transposition in cents is also provided)]
[(and converted to ration.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 569 726 [
[(Notice now in order to avoid Doppler)]
[(effects when the chunk size changes we)]
[(have a sample and hold unit, which can)]
[(be an issue if you're dealing with very)]
[(low frequencies that never end up)]
[(triggering the sample and hold...)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 571 620 [
[(You might also want to have a way to)]
[(retrigger the loop to sync it with some)]
[(other process. By the time we had all)]
[(this built the patch would be fairly)]
[(involved. For now, we'll move on to the)]
[(next example...)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 628 297 [
[(--- 48003 samples ---)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
